DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:[related] EP event: Other events - DEVE delegation to Bolivia on 27
 -29 October 2026 - 27-10-2026 - Development
DESCRIPTION:A delegation of 3 Members\, led by MEP Reinhold LOPATKA (EPP)\,
  traveled to Bolivia from 27 to 29 October. The purpose of the mission was
  to review the EU development portfolio in Bolivia\, particularly in the c
 ontext of the current programming period. The mission particularly focused
  on: - human development issues. Bolivia\, a lower-middle-income country\,
  continues to face high levels of economic and social inequality\, especia
 lly in rural and indigenous areas. These levels of inequality are among th
 e highest in Latin America and represent major obstacles to the country's 
 development\; - climate ac\n\nhttps://www.europarl.europa.eu/thinktank/en/
 events/details/deve-delegation-to-bolivia-on-27-29-octo/20261014MIS04296
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.europarl.europa.eu/thinktank/en/events/details/deve-delegat
 ion-to-bolivia-on-27-29-octo/20261014MIS04296
END:VEVENT
