BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:872b3b4c180d5c349f18@policy-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261128T050814Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261126
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261127
SUMMARY:[Water Resilience\, Water Initiative] EP event: Workshops - New Kno
 wledge and Innovation Community in the field of water\, marine and maritim
 e sectors-EIT Water - 09-12-2026 - Scientific foresight
DESCRIPTION:Europe faces growing water stress\, droughts\, floods and degra
 dation of aquatic ecosystems\, made worse by regional disparities and clim
 ate change. Research too often fails to become practical solutions and ski
 lled jobs\, because efforts are fragmented across regions and sectors. The
  launch of EIT Water\, the new Knowledge and Innovation Community (KIC) on
  water\, marine and maritime sectors\, together with the EU Water Resilien
 ce Strategy\, offers an opportunity to bring innovation\, education and en
 trepreneurship together and speed up Europe’s transition to water and bl
 ue resilience. This STOA event\n\nhttps://www.europarl.europa.eu/thinktank
 /en/events/details/new-knowledge-and-innovation-community-i/20261110WKS073
 21
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.europarl.europa.eu/thinktank/en/events/details/new-knowledg
 e-and-innovation-community-i/20261110WKS07321
END:VEVENT
